  "ruleText": "He-P 819.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the licensing requirements for all case management agencies (CMA) pursuant to RSA 151:2, I(b).\n\nSource. #5633, eff 5-27-93; ss by #7006, INTERIM, eff 5-26-99, EXPIRED: 9-23-99\n\nNew. #10260, eff 1-25-13; ss by #13709, eff 8-1-23",
